    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">45 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Machine-coding case</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Observer + Strategy + Decorator</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Scheduling</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Notification Service</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Design the service that tells customers, sellers and delivery partners what happened: business events in, e-mail / SMS / push / in-app messages out. Observer for \"who hears about what\", one Strategy per channel, Decorators for retries, provider failover and rate limits, templates, user preferences, priorities, scheduled sends and a delivery history. Running code in Java, Python and C++14.</p>\n"
